# Example build events for `hydra-build-tracker --replay`.
#
# One JSON `BuildEvent` per line, replayed with a delay in between
# (`--replay-delay-secs`, default 1). Lines starting with `#` are ignored.
#
# `build_id` has to match a build id the queue-runner handed back to
# hydra-evaluator; watch the hydra-evaluator log or the hydra-build-tracking
# queue for the real values and edit this file accordingly.
